{"script":"sj_041_01","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":false,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1d","noIn":false,"x":280,"img":"chara041_1","scaleY":1,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","y":-350,"mirrow":false},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"transTime":0,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":false,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1d","timeBak":300,"noIn":false,"x":280,"img":"chara041_1","scaleY":1,"nonStandBright":false,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","y":-350,"mirrow":false},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"text":"[show]啊，伙伴。嗯，你们的营地修得挺规整，不介意的话我想作为治安队野外扎营的参考。[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"text":"[show]你说，这里是作为活动据点修建的，武装力量在野外扎营的知识你并不了解？那我更要对你刮目相看了。[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"text":"[show]简单来说，这座营地的选址本就易守难攻，周围资源充沛，并且足够隐蔽。[r][l]建筑布局也非常合理，岗哨视野开阔，所有人员互通有无，即使被敌人突袭，撤离的代价也非常低。[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"text":"[show]唯一的问题是，你们过得太散漫了。[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"text":"[show]不然，我可以当你的顾问和教官，咱们一起把营地修得更加规整，建立严格的训练计划和规章制度，将这里都打造成更加高效率的治安队营地！[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1d","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"text":"[show]嗯？你说你们也不是治安队，不用做到那种地步？[r][l]嘁，我们明明可以合作，训练出一支强大守序的治安队的。真是可惜。[l][cm][hide]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"transTime":0,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":false,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1d","timeBak":300,"noIn":false,"x":280,"img":"chara041_1","scaleY":1,"nonStandBright":false,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","y":-350,"mirrow":false},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"埃迪蒂-对我们的营地感觉如何？"}